WEBVTT

00:13.471 --> 00:14.305
It's no use!

00:14.389 --> 00:15.348
We can't hold on any longer!

00:27.110 --> 00:28.653
Begin advancing!

00:28.737 --> 00:30.613
Save my people!

01:00.351 --> 01:02.854
So... amazing.

01:04.189 --> 01:06.399
It ends here!

01:15.200 --> 01:16.451
Are you all right?

01:17.118 --> 01:19.788
Don't worry, my people.

01:19.871 --> 01:22.165
Let's get out of these tunnels together.

01:22.248 --> 01:25.460
I'll make sure your efforts are rewarded.

02:59.762 --> 03:02.640
I didn't think anyone
would come to our rescue.

03:02.724 --> 03:05.727
It's nothing.
Orders from the Holy Knights.

03:05.810 --> 03:08.855
From now on, each of you
will take up a weapon.

03:08.938 --> 03:12.734
His Majesty Norgalle is a specialist
in tuning sacred seals.

03:12.817 --> 03:14.193
His Majesty?

03:15.069 --> 03:18.197
In a place without sunlight
as an energy source,

03:18.281 --> 03:20.658
the sacred seal will deplete faster.

03:20.742 --> 03:25.121
Since the amount of luminescence
in objects is insufficient,

03:25.705 --> 03:30.084
a sacred seal loses its function
after being used several times.

03:30.627 --> 03:32.962
However, with my own hands,

03:33.046 --> 03:35.506
I can create a sacred seal

03:35.590 --> 03:38.218
that's incomparable
to those shoddy, mass-produced models.

03:38.301 --> 03:41.471
A divine weapon that performs superbly
with minimal consumption.

03:42.055 --> 03:45.433
This is the proof of a true king.

03:45.516 --> 03:46.851
Xylo.

03:46.935 --> 03:48.895
How much longer can you fight?

03:50.480 --> 03:51.522
Let's see.

03:52.815 --> 03:54.025
What's that ornament?

03:54.108 --> 03:55.193
What?

03:55.276 --> 03:57.820
Nothing. I was just curious.

03:58.613 --> 04:02.283
It measures the amount
of luminescence in my body.

04:02.367 --> 04:04.994
The intensity of its glow reveals
how much luminescence remains.

04:05.078 --> 04:06.788
Your amount of luminescence

04:06.871 --> 04:09.207
is several times greater than
that of a normal person.

04:09.290 --> 04:11.584
No wonder you're my elite soldier.

04:11.668 --> 04:14.003
Thank you for the compliment,
Your Majesty.

04:16.631 --> 04:19.342
But I probably can't hold out much longer.

04:25.306 --> 04:27.934
The message came too late.

04:28.017 --> 04:32.438
Laborers are never a priority.

04:33.982 --> 04:36.818
Thank you for the water.

04:37.402 --> 04:38.528
You can keep it.

04:42.740 --> 04:44.784
Thank you.

04:44.867 --> 04:47.203
Are there no other survivors?

04:47.287 --> 04:48.746
There are fewer than I thought.

04:49.831 --> 04:53.626
At first, there were about 50 survivors.

04:53.710 --> 04:57.505
But suddenly, people started
saying they heard a sound.

04:57.588 --> 04:58.464
A sound?

04:58.548 --> 04:59.632
Yes.

04:59.716 --> 05:02.427
After that, they disappeared
while everyone was sleeping.

05:02.510 --> 05:06.264
When they came back,
they turned into creatures.

05:08.391 --> 05:09.767
That's why

05:10.518 --> 05:11.894
everyone was all...

05:13.896 --> 05:15.982
We had no other choice.

05:20.611 --> 05:22.488
Everyone's got their weapons, right?

05:22.572 --> 05:25.450
Are you ready, my people?

05:26.993 --> 05:28.828
Tatsuya will take point.

05:28.911 --> 05:30.538
Xylo, you...

05:30.621 --> 05:31.956
I know.

05:32.040 --> 05:36.169
It's impossible to retreat
in an orderly manner.

05:36.252 --> 05:39.797
I'll take the rear. I'll follow behind.

05:39.881 --> 05:43.009
Everyone, watch each other's backs.

05:43.092 --> 05:46.345
I have no intention
of abandoning any of you!

05:48.389 --> 05:49.390
Xylo.

05:49.474 --> 05:53.352
If you survive, I'll make you
commander in chief.

05:53.436 --> 05:55.480
It'll be the highest honor.

05:55.563 --> 05:57.565
Okay, I'll be waiting.

05:59.108 --> 06:00.526
- What's going on?
- That's intense.

06:01.152 --> 06:02.570
They attacked before we moved.

06:08.534 --> 06:09.577
Stand up!

06:10.661 --> 06:13.539
Try to protect yourselves!

06:14.332 --> 06:15.500
Take this!

06:22.590 --> 06:24.050
Change of plans.

06:24.133 --> 06:25.635
Set up a battle line here.

06:25.718 --> 06:26.677
Finish them off!

06:26.761 --> 06:28.638
No... No way!

06:28.721 --> 06:30.139
There are so many of them!

06:31.682 --> 06:33.017
Damn it!

06:33.101 --> 06:35.561
This is starting to feel
like a punishment.

06:35.645 --> 06:38.648
Let's decide the order of our deaths.

06:38.731 --> 06:41.067
You will be the first to die, Xylo.

06:41.150 --> 06:43.319
I couldn't ask for more.

06:43.402 --> 06:46.030
I'm next, and the third is Tatsuya.

06:46.614 --> 06:48.866
Compared to my loyal subjects
who risked their lives,

06:48.950 --> 06:51.869
our lives are worthless.

06:54.997 --> 06:56.582
What a great king you are.

07:06.217 --> 07:08.594
That's all. Return to your posts.

07:08.678 --> 07:09.637
Yes, Commander!

07:17.353 --> 07:19.730
Ever since we parted ways
with the hero she made a covenant with,

07:19.814 --> 07:21.315
she's been like that.

07:21.399 --> 07:23.526
It doesn't look like she
can be used as a weapon.

07:23.609 --> 07:25.653
We'll depart once preparations
are complete.

07:25.736 --> 07:27.238
We'll defeat the Demon Lord.

07:33.911 --> 07:35.663
Stop the bleeding of the injured first.

07:35.746 --> 07:37.248
Just take a small sip of water.

07:41.878 --> 07:43.838
There's no time for you
to lie on the ground!

07:43.921 --> 07:46.048
If you're ready, then get up!

07:46.132 --> 07:47.717
I... I can't move anymore.

07:47.800 --> 07:49.135
- My legs hurt.
- There's no way we can do this.

07:49.218 --> 07:50.470
I have no strength.

07:50.553 --> 07:51.929
What are you doing?

07:52.013 --> 07:53.598
Do you want to be eaten?

07:56.350 --> 07:57.351
Everyone.

08:00.104 --> 08:01.355
Until now,

08:01.439 --> 08:05.109
you have overcome countless trials
through your own strength,

08:05.193 --> 08:08.321
risking your lives to uphold this kingdom.

08:08.404 --> 08:09.822
Well then,

08:09.906 --> 08:12.492
what are you afraid of?

08:14.911 --> 08:17.622
Now, stand up.

08:24.337 --> 08:28.090
If you guys say so,
then we can definitely do it.

08:28.174 --> 08:30.718
Man, he's more persuasive than I am.

08:30.801 --> 08:33.221
That sacred seal on your neck...

08:33.304 --> 08:35.890
You're heroes, aren't you?

08:35.973 --> 08:38.184
Oh, you knew?

08:38.267 --> 08:42.104
Did you hear that the heroes are
the world's most vile criminal group?

08:42.188 --> 08:47.026
Even though you're criminals,
you came here to save us.

08:47.109 --> 08:50.112
You didn't abandon people like us.

08:50.696 --> 08:52.615
So I figured

08:52.698 --> 08:55.868
I could at least die with some dignity.

08:55.952 --> 08:57.620
Don't be ridiculous.

08:57.703 --> 08:59.789
I won't let you die that easily.

08:59.872 --> 09:00.831
Yes.

09:00.915 --> 09:03.251
You who faithfully serve this kingdom,

09:03.334 --> 09:06.921
covered in mud and drenched
in sweat from your labor,

09:07.004 --> 09:08.548
are my treasures.

09:09.882 --> 09:13.719
I won't let anyone take you away from me.

09:23.271 --> 09:24.272
Damn it.

09:24.355 --> 09:27.483
If only we had a probe seal,
we'd know exactly how many there are.

09:28.317 --> 09:29.151
Bring it on!

09:29.235 --> 09:30.444
We can't die here.

09:30.528 --> 09:32.154
Ready your weapons! They're coming!

09:37.243 --> 09:39.120
Left! Incoming!

10:02.143 --> 10:04.020
That's it! Fight back!

10:06.939 --> 10:09.609
Go, my people!

10:10.943 --> 10:12.194
Your Majesty!

10:14.238 --> 10:15.364
Turn to ash!

10:23.581 --> 10:24.457
Damn it!

10:24.540 --> 10:25.458
Boss!

10:44.435 --> 10:45.519
What--

10:49.690 --> 10:51.984
Sorry to keep you waiting!

10:53.653 --> 10:56.238
The goddess of swords, Teoritta,

10:56.322 --> 10:58.407
is here!

11:01.369 --> 11:02.703
All right, everyone!

11:02.787 --> 11:06.707
Praise me all you want!

11:08.542 --> 11:09.710
Goddess,

11:09.794 --> 11:12.046
thank you for bestowing
your blessings upon us.

11:12.129 --> 11:13.798
I'm eternally grateful!

11:13.881 --> 11:15.633
Leave it to me, Norgalle!

11:15.716 --> 11:19.136
As long as my knight and I are here,
there is no chance of defeat!

11:20.805 --> 11:23.099
All of you, build the barricades.

11:23.182 --> 11:25.309
I will grant the sacred seals,

11:25.393 --> 11:27.436
and then, plant the completed swords
on the ground!

11:27.520 --> 11:29.271
Yes... Yes, sir!

11:31.065 --> 11:32.817
What are you doing?

11:32.900 --> 11:34.902
What about the Holy Knights?

11:34.985 --> 11:36.362
I snuck out.

11:36.445 --> 11:39.073
No one can stop someone as great as me!

11:39.156 --> 11:43.035
Now, Xylo, hurry up and sing my praises!

11:44.203 --> 11:45.996
As if I'd praise you.

11:46.080 --> 11:49.708
Why? Are you saying I was too late?

11:50.292 --> 11:54.797
But it is your fault for leaving me there.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.258
I will not forgive you for that.
Don't you ever again...

11:57.341 --> 11:59.260
I'll say it as many times as you want.

11:59.343 --> 12:02.805
It's not like I expected you
to help or anything.

12:06.851 --> 12:08.352
Then what is it?

12:09.019 --> 12:11.605
Tell me what you want then.

12:12.982 --> 12:14.233
Don't go getting yourself killed.

12:15.317 --> 12:18.779
Don't throw your life away
for others just to earn a little praise.

12:19.655 --> 12:21.699
It's okay if you can't help. Just live.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.081
You are right.

12:29.165 --> 12:31.625
It is precisely because you
say things like that

12:31.709 --> 12:34.003
that I am willing to risk my life.

12:34.086 --> 12:35.129
What--

12:35.212 --> 12:40.050
You are distancing yourself
for my safety, right?

12:40.134 --> 12:41.844
Why is it like this?
You've got to be kidding me.

12:41.927 --> 12:46.307
However, whatever you think
has nothing to do with me.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.641
What?

12:47.725 --> 12:49.226
I am a goddess,

12:49.310 --> 12:52.354
an existence born to aid others.

12:52.438 --> 12:54.648
I want everyone to praise me.

12:54.732 --> 12:56.066
I want to be appreciated.

12:56.734 --> 13:00.029
Even if a goddess is born to be this way,

13:01.238 --> 13:05.993
I still want to believe I am a great being
and live my life by that belief.

13:08.496 --> 13:10.998
That's too bad, Xylo.

13:11.081 --> 13:12.625
Even if you are my knight,

13:12.708 --> 13:15.252
you cannot stop my wish.

13:20.716 --> 13:23.177
Take your positions! They're coming again!

13:23.260 --> 13:24.595
Everyone, get behind the barricades!

13:24.678 --> 13:26.805
That way, they won't be able
to come up from the ground.

13:29.308 --> 13:30.935
Teoritta, stay back.

13:31.018 --> 13:34.647
Xylo, if you cannot stand
my self-sacrificing spirit,

13:35.523 --> 13:38.609
then all you have to do is protect me.

13:40.945 --> 13:42.446
Oh, is that so?

13:46.408 --> 13:48.494
If you say so, then let's do this!

13:51.830 --> 13:53.249
Take this!

13:56.710 --> 13:57.753
Again!

13:59.547 --> 14:01.090
What else?

14:05.344 --> 14:07.930
Is this the sound?

14:22.570 --> 14:23.863
My knight.

14:24.822 --> 14:25.906
You...

14:31.245 --> 14:32.997
It's the power of protection and healing.

14:33.080 --> 14:35.374
That should help
with the ringing in your ears.

14:37.001 --> 14:38.586
Mind your own business!

14:40.087 --> 14:41.422
My knight, it's not yet...

14:42.882 --> 14:44.633
Save your complaints for later.

14:44.717 --> 14:47.887
Looks like it is here.

14:49.763 --> 14:52.182
The Demon Blight's master.

15:04.945 --> 15:06.864
Found...

15:06.947 --> 15:08.407
it.

15:08.490 --> 15:10.159
I found it.

15:14.914 --> 15:16.832
I found it!

15:16.916 --> 15:19.919
That's the Demon Lord, Lotus.

15:28.636 --> 15:29.678
The sound...

15:29.762 --> 15:31.639
The... the sound is...

15:31.722 --> 15:32.723
The sound is...

15:32.806 --> 15:33.891
Don't move.

15:33.974 --> 15:37.895
- That Demon Lord pollutes the mind.
- But it seems to be saying something.

15:39.939 --> 15:41.065
Hey!

15:43.400 --> 15:44.693
Damn it!

15:45.611 --> 15:46.612
Hey!

15:46.695 --> 15:49.239
Un... Unforgivable!

15:49.323 --> 15:53.410
How... How dare you try to seduce my people!

15:53.494 --> 15:56.956
Damn rebels! Wretched usurpers!

15:57.039 --> 15:58.499
Teoritta.

15:58.582 --> 16:00.834
We can't leave the sacred seal barricade.

16:00.918 --> 16:02.920
Let's support Tatsuya from here!

16:05.965 --> 16:08.467
Is he going to be okay?

16:08.550 --> 16:11.220
The ringing in his ears
doesn't seem to affect him.

16:11.303 --> 16:13.597
Don't worry about him.
Give me more longswords.

16:13.681 --> 16:14.598
That's right.

16:15.182 --> 16:17.476
Rely on me as much as you can!

16:19.812 --> 16:21.730
Been a while
since my last long-range fight.

16:24.775 --> 16:25.943
Tatsuya, advance!

16:26.026 --> 16:27.987
Kill the Demon Lord!

16:38.747 --> 16:40.624
Tatsuya, charge in!

16:46.714 --> 16:47.631
More!

16:47.715 --> 16:49.341
Give me more swords!

16:50.509 --> 16:51.427
Yes!

17:03.647 --> 17:04.732
Cut it down!

17:13.115 --> 17:15.993
- It's a decoy! Is that not the main body?
- Xylo, look over there!

17:19.788 --> 17:21.665
Is this the main body?

17:24.209 --> 17:26.086
Damn it, did I use it all?

17:27.504 --> 17:30.132
Found them! Immediately support
the goddess and rescue the civilians!

17:33.052 --> 17:34.678
Stop! Don't come any closer!

17:38.182 --> 17:40.225
Wh-What's going on?

17:48.567 --> 17:49.902
Damn it!

18:10.672 --> 18:12.007
Your Majesty!

18:12.966 --> 18:16.887
I will protect my people!

18:16.970 --> 18:18.097
Unforgivable!

18:18.180 --> 18:21.266
Curse you, usurpers!

18:30.150 --> 18:31.527
Your Majesty, that's it!

18:31.610 --> 18:33.362
Burn the main body!

18:33.987 --> 18:36.240
You invaders who trespassed on my land...

18:39.243 --> 18:40.119
Damn it!

18:57.803 --> 19:00.556
- Hurry! We'll handle this!
- Xylo!

19:01.265 --> 19:03.684
Go finish it off, my knight!

19:06.353 --> 19:08.856
I'll burn you to a crisp, you bastard!

19:12.943 --> 19:15.112
Damn it! What do I have to do to...

19:22.035 --> 19:26.331
Unforgivable! Unforgivable!

19:30.794 --> 19:37.009
Unforgivable...!

19:37.092 --> 19:41.763
Unforgivable...!

19:47.769 --> 19:49.146
Norgalle.

19:49.730 --> 19:51.899
Norgalle, stay there!

19:51.982 --> 19:54.443
I'll save you now!

19:59.364 --> 20:00.490
Your Majesty!

20:05.287 --> 20:07.664
You truly are a magnificent king!

20:35.442 --> 20:38.820
- Did we succeed?
- Those heroes...

20:42.783 --> 20:44.201
This should stop the bleeding for now.

20:45.577 --> 20:48.789
Did I make it in time this time?

20:49.790 --> 20:52.834
Where are my people?

20:52.918 --> 20:54.670
I must protect them.

21:05.639 --> 21:08.267
We did it, my knight.

21:10.811 --> 21:11.812
Yeah.

21:17.067 --> 21:18.735
I'm glad you returned safely.

21:18.819 --> 21:20.904
Welcome back, Dad!

21:27.661 --> 21:29.037
Rajit?

21:29.913 --> 21:32.833
Oh dear, you must be exhausted.

21:37.004 --> 21:38.714
Don't worry about His Majesty.

21:38.797 --> 21:41.800
He was sent to the repair shop
as soon as he got out.

21:41.883 --> 21:46.221
Though his leg will be replaced
with someone else's.

21:46.305 --> 21:48.932
I hope we can at least
give him a better leg.

21:49.016 --> 21:51.435
Thanks to that crazy king,

21:51.518 --> 21:53.395
many lives were spared.

21:53.478 --> 21:54.396
The heroes?

21:54.479 --> 21:55.314
No way.

21:55.397 --> 21:56.857
Aren't they heinous criminals?

21:56.940 --> 21:57.983
I can't believe it.

21:58.066 --> 21:59.359
What's going on?

22:03.155 --> 22:04.281
I'm sure

22:04.364 --> 22:08.410
the townspeople will understand one day.

22:09.828 --> 22:11.204
Don't worry about it.

22:11.288 --> 22:12.456
I'm used to it.

22:13.040 --> 22:15.417
No matter what others say,

22:15.500 --> 22:17.502
we're alive because of you guys.

22:19.171 --> 22:21.006
Thanks to you,

22:21.089 --> 22:23.550
I won't have to die with dignity.

22:25.469 --> 22:27.262
If you want to thank someone,
thank His Majesty.

22:27.345 --> 22:30.140
Yes, one day, I will.

22:30.223 --> 22:34.227
We can finally celebrate
our child's birthday.

22:34.311 --> 22:37.272
Now, don't you have something to give him?

22:37.355 --> 22:39.191
Yes...

22:44.237 --> 22:46.573
Thank you, Sir Hero.

22:53.997 --> 22:56.083
Oh, little girl.

22:56.166 --> 22:59.211
My knight is only able to be
so active because I am here.

22:59.294 --> 23:03.006
First, sing my praises,
for I am the goddess.

23:03.090 --> 23:05.133
Goddess?

23:05.217 --> 23:06.301
Stop it.

23:06.384 --> 23:08.303
If you're a kid,
don't ask other kids for things.

23:09.179 --> 23:11.348
A kid?! Are you talking about me?

23:11.431 --> 23:12.599
That's rude.

23:12.682 --> 23:14.309
If you do not watch your tone--

23:14.392 --> 23:15.352
Be quiet.

23:19.147 --> 23:22.859
I appreciate the thought,
but it doesn't suit me.

23:26.780 --> 23:27.906
Teoritta.

23:29.324 --> 23:30.700
You keep it.

23:36.373 --> 23:38.416
This flower is cute.

23:39.084 --> 23:41.253
Didn't know a kid
could appreciate flowers.

23:41.962 --> 23:44.840
My knight, you are doing it again!

23:44.923 --> 23:48.426
They broke several rules.

23:48.510 --> 23:50.220
I'm taking them back to be punished.

23:50.303 --> 23:51.388
Wait.

23:51.888 --> 23:56.685
Even if they are heinous criminals,
they still saved many lives.

23:56.768 --> 23:58.979
At least let them be thanked.

23:59.062 --> 24:00.272
But...

24:00.355 --> 24:02.566
That's far better than someone
who flaunts the authority on his chest

24:02.649 --> 24:05.569
and has never fought a single battle.

24:12.242 --> 24:14.244
- Xylo Forbartz.
- Don't you think

24:14.327 --> 24:16.371
- The hero who slew a goddess, huh?
- this flower suits me?

24:20.167 --> 24:21.168
Right?

24:21.251 --> 24:24.171
- Next time, with my knight...
- Hey, it's almost time to go.

24:24.254 --> 24:26.965
Huh? Let's stay a little longer.

24:27.048 --> 24:28.717
I want to talk more too.

24:28.800 --> 24:29.885
Right!
